    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Updated to version 0.28.0
  * embedding: per-request EmbeddingGemma 2 image budget (#870)
  * embeddings: support video inputs (#869)
  * qwen-image: stream safetensors weights, not mapping (#830)
  * qwen: tune Qwen3.8-27B verification GEMM rows 2-8 (#874)
  * Release notes: https://github.com/gufo-org/gufo/releases/tag/v0.28.0
- Update generated using pbuild-ai

- Updated to version 0.27.0
  * serve: add cache_persist=false to skip disk cache (#811)
  * serve: support generated token logprobs (#814)
  * loader: retry failed unbuffered weight reads (#858)
  * qwen-flash: bound draft-ID remapping and blocks (#849)
  * qwen-flash: preserve YaRN in batched MTP catch-up (#854)
  * qwen38-flash-next: run Q8_0 weights on F32 kernels (#788)
  * qwen38-flash-next: grow qfn_mmq stream arenas (#740)
  * qwen: size Q8_0 prefill GEMM activation scratch (#777)
  * qwen-flash: keep fused WMMA prefill past 262,144 (#866)
  * qwen: run split K-quant prefill GEMM as 16-row pass (#779)
  * Release notes: https://github.com/gufo-
    org/gufo/releases/tag/v0.27.0
  * Release notes: https://github.com/gufo-org/gufo/releases/tag/v0.27.0
- Update generated using pbuild-ai

- Updated to version 0.26.0
  * embedding: support native audio embeddings (#819)
  * serve: add llama-server's /apply-template (#821)
  * serve: let --cache-ram-bytes turn the RAM cache off (#783)
  * serve: select EmbeddingGemma 2 checkpoint prompts by name (#823)
  * audio: drop resident safetensors pages after the</comment>
