  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>f11ca27bc5438574ce3a3ade17152782</srcmd5>
    <version>0.34.0</version>
    <time>1794591183</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Updated to version 0.34.0
  * audio: BREAKING: decode EmbeddingGemma 2 audio in
    Rust and drop libsndfile and soxr (#1118)
  * cli: deprecate --draft-tokens, --min-draft-tokens
    and --draft-policy (#1124)
  * extensions: record source revision of external
    extensions (#1162)
  * h3: add FL2VA first- and last-frame keyframe
    conditioning (#998)
  * cache: drop disk-only metadata admission limits and
    size validation by candidate (#934, #1121)
  * ext: install sources containing file symlinks (#1151)
  * qwen38-flash-next: recover stale MTP backoff after
    batch observations (#912)
  * serve: continue live frontier after re-tokenized
    answers (#1154, #1158)
  * serve: deprecate unused shared-byte cache metric (#1129)
  * serve: do not charge prompt state for preallocated
    session runners (#1164)
  * serve: refuse prompts exceeding host prompt-state
    budget (#1083)
  * serve: return tool-call numbers as the model wrote
    them (#1146)
  * tools: cap JSON numbers at llama.cpp 16 digits (#1168)
  * tools: match llama.cpp nested object defaults (#1128)
  * core: reduce CPU overhead in sampling and n-gram
    lookups (#1127)
  * qwen38: reuse Q8 activations from batched HC mixing
    (#958)
  * qwen: fuse batched target FFN HC pair (#969)</comment>
    <requestid>1397136</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="4" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>07f8cd9e3137324089358d5a47b42bfd</srcmd5>
    <version>0.35.0</version>
    <time>1795103781</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>NOTE: this requires now the also submitted xrt package

- Updated to version 0.35.0
  * serve: BREAKING: parse multipart/form-data per RFC
    7578 (#1176)
  * npu: run EmbeddingGemma 2, Qwen3-ASR and Qwen3-TTS
    on the XDNA NPU (--npu) (#1216)
  * npu: run XDNA programs through XRT from core and
    extensions (#1186)
  * npu: load XRT from a module on first NPU use
    on Linux (#1229)
  * npu: cut host overhead of EmbeddingGemma 2 (#1225)
  * model: download extension-provided model weights with
    gufo model (#1203)
  * ext: trim reasoning separator after a closed block
    (#1210)
  * qwen-image: true CFG, image-to-image and
    multi-reference CFG edits in GPU memory (#1212)
  * sched: require a text scheduling profile and drop
    the legacy prefill budget (#1175)
  * serve: add the A1111 (sdapi) image API (#1214)
  * serve: do not split prefill passes without prefix
    reuse (#1184)
  * serve: make --max-pending 0 reject when all sessions
    are busy (#1207)
  * cache: count recovered manifest storage once and
    coordinate RAM and disk retention (#1183, #1194)
  * cache: reuse dependency metadata during recovery,
    share transfer streams and sync disk checkpoints
    concurrently (#1195, #1196, #1205)
  * hip: match Clang 23 WMMA builtin signatures on
    gfx1151 (#945)</comment>
    <requestid>1398601</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="5" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>f2964c6a0b32b269918c943e36d3322c</srcmd5>
    <version>0.37.0</version>
    <time>1795805015</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- make it possible to configure (and run) multiple instances
  in parallel via gufo@ service
- pre-configure some default models

- Updated to version 0.37.0
  * core: BREAKING: encode PNG images in Rust and drop
    libpng
  * serve: BREAKING: serve HTTP with tokio and hyper
  * tools: BREAKING: bound tool grammar value-kind checks
    on recursive schemas
  * ext: expose Flash-Next stages and weight sources as
    experimental extension headers
  * ext: expose the Qwen family as an experimental
    extension library
  * ext: let extensions depend on and link other
    extensions
  * ext: let loadable modules depend on in-tree
    extensions
  * ext: stream mixture-of-experts weights from disk into
    a bounded device cache
  * inkling2: add Inkling 2 Mini
  * qwen: load tokenizer from Hugging Face tokenizer.json
  * diagnose: warn on small GTT and log GPU memory on
    load failure
  * cli: let runner providers supply their own speculative
    draft
  * cli: pass speculative settings to providers loaded by
    prompt
  * cli: stream chat answers from runner-only providers
  * loom: constrain Inkling 2 tool calls and keep automatic</comment>
    <requestid>1401057</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
